    {
      "text": "Overflowing with beauty and majesty, this strong Pokémon appears in ancient Eastern folklore.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fire burning inside its body serves as the energy to fuel it as it runs great distances. It appears in many legends.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Legends tell of its fighting alongside a general and conquering a whole country.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "There are so many old tales about them that they’re called legendary Pokémon, but there are way more of them around than you’d expect.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
